     1739                                  and utd-lines-attr.lineNum   eq ilineNum
     1740                                  and utd-lines-attr.attr-code eq iattrcode
     1741      no-lock no-error.
     1742      if not available utd-lines-attr
     1743      then do:
     1744         if iattrval ne ?
     1745            and iattrval ne ""
     1746         then do:
